@ Generated from data/our-game/dialogue.json; edit that file, then regenerate.
Leg_Text_Lab_Welcome::
	.string "YEW: Each of you will\nreceive a POKéMON to\paccompany you throughout the\nprogram.\pChoosing a partner is an\nimportant--$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Whisper::
	.string "NEVILLE: Bet mine takes one\nlook at me and asks for\psomeone else.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Interrupt::
	.string "YEW: Who is interrupting me?$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Nerves::
	.string "NEVILLE: Sorry, Professor.\nJust nerves.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Listen::
	.string "YEW: Then take a breath.\nYou'll need to listen if you\pintend to learn anything.\pYou. Come forward. Since the\ntwo of you are so eager, you\pmay begin.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Listening::
	.string "ASTRID: Professor, we were\nlistening.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Hear::
	.string "YEW: And you'll hear the\ninstructions perfectly well\pfrom there.\pTake your time. Have a look\nat each of them.\pYou'll be doing a great deal\nof growing together.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Choose::
	.string "Choose your first partner.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Confirm::
	.string "YEW: {STR_VAR_1}. A fine\nchoice.\pIs this the POKéMON you'd\nlike?$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Nickname::
	.string "Give your new partner a\nnickname?$"

Leg_Text_Lab_NevChoice::
	.string "NEVILLE: Oh, good choice. I\nwas thinking about that one.\pWell. That one and three of\nthe others.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_AstridTurn::
	.string "YEW: Astrid. Your turn.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_AstridChoice::
	.string "ASTRID: We're going to do\nsomething worthwhile. You\pand me.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_EdwulfTurn::
	.string "YEW: Edwulf?$"

Leg_Text_Lab_EdwulfChoice::
	.string "EDWULF: This one, please.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_NevilleTurn::
	.string "YEW: And Neville.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_NevilleChoice::
	.string "NEVILLE: Mostly.\pHey, {PLAYER}, do you also\nthink this {STR_VAR_1} looks\plike me a little?\pHello, little monster. I'm\nNeville. I will be your\psupreme commander from now\non.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Serious::
	.string "ASTRID: You could try taking\nthis seriously.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Introduced::
	.string "NEVILLE: I introduced\nmyself!$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Before::
	.string "ASTRID: I meant before that.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Important::
	.string "EDWULF: She was explaining\nsomething important.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Heard::
	.string "ASTRID: Then perhaps you can\ntell your partner what to\pdo.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Notes::
	.string "EDWULF: You'll still have to\nunderstand them.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Fun::
	.string "NEVILLE: You two are really\ngood at sucking the fun out\pof everything. It's quite\nimpressive.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Practice::
	.string "YEW: Maybe instead of all\nthis bickering you could\pchannel this aggression into\nsomething useful.\pIf you have something to\nprove, we have a practice\pfloor.\pAstrid and Edwulf, together.\n{PLAYER}, you'll partner\pwith Neville.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Paper::
	.string "NEVILLE: This is sooo much\nbetter than throwing wads of\ppaper at their backs.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Safe::
	.string "YEW: The POKéMON will be\nquite safe. I'll be\psupervising.\pNow, take your places.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_ReadyA::
	.string "ASTRID: Ready, Edwulf?$"

Leg_Text_Lab_ReadyE::
	.string "EDWULF: Yes.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_ReadyN::
	.string "NEVILLE: We've got this,\n{PLAYER}.\pReady?$"

Leg_Text_Lab_DefeatA::
	.string "This doesn't prove anything.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_DefeatE::
	.string "...$"

Leg_Text_Lab_WinN::
	.string "NEVILLE: You guys really\nshould have listened better.\pGood work, soldier!$"

Leg_Text_Lab_WinA::
	.string "ASTRID: This doesn't prove\nanything.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_WinY::
	.string "YEW: Well done, {PLAYER}.\nNeville.\pAstrid, don't rush your next\ndecision because the last\pone went badly.\pEdwulf, you're allowed to\nspeak to your partner. They\pcannot follow a plan you\nkeep to yourself.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_LoseA::
	.string "ASTRID: Yes! Well done!\pWe make a good team.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_LoseE::
	.string "EDWULF: You nearly went too\nquickly.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_LoseA2::
	.string "ASTRID: Nearly.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_LoseN::
	.string "NEVILLE: Sorry, {PLAYER}. I\nthought that would work.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_LoseY::
	.string "YEW: A good first showing,\nAstrid. Edwulf.\p{PLAYER}, keep an eye on\nyour partner's position as\pwell as your own.\pNeville, you knew what you\nwanted to do. Next time,\pgive the instruction\nclearly.\pHesitation makes it harder\nfor your POKéMON to\punderstand you.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Rested::
	.string "YEW: There. All rested.\pRemember how that felt.\nThere will be plenty of\popportunities to improve.\pAnd you won't always be\nbattling the people you\palready know.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_JustAsWell::
	.string "NEVILLE: Probably just as\nwell.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Program::
	.string "YEW: Your first destination\nis the next town over.\pFrom there, you'll begin the\njourney through our eight\pgyms. Each gym leader will\nassess your progress and\paward a badge when you're\nready to advance.\pBetween gyms, you'll meet\nother trainers, encounter\pwild POKéMON, and learn to\nmanage your team.\pYour badges and assessments\nwill help us find the work\pbest suited to your\nabilities.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Service::
	.string "ASTRID: And the people who\ndo best get considered for\pregional service?$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Opportunities::
	.string "YEW: They do. There are\nexcellent opportunities for\pcapable, dedicated trainers.\pBut you have eight badges to\nearn before we discuss\pthose.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_VictoryRoad::
	.string "EDWULF: And Victory Road.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Graduation::
	.string "YEW: Yes. The final\nchallenge before graduation.\pYou'll hear plenty about\nthat along the way.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_HowFar::
	.string "NEVILLE: How far are we\nsupposed to travel on our\pown?$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Routes::
	.string "YEW: As far as the program\ntakes you.\pThere's no need to look so\nworried. Our regional\padministration works very\nhard to keep the training\proutes safe.\pYou'll find POKéMON Centers\nin every town, clearly\pmarked routes, and staff\nready to help.\pThe route numbers will guide\nyou through the program\ptoward your next gym. Follow\nthe signs, and pay attention\pto official notices.\pHelp is never far away.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Equipment::
	.string "YEW: One last piece of\nequipment.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Dex::
	.string "YEW: This is a POKéDEX: an\nelectronic guide that\pidentifies POKéMON and\nrecords your encounters with\pthem.\pIt helps us assess your\nprogress as trainers while\pproviding the administration\nwith valuable information\pabout the region's wildlife.\pWhen you see a species you\ndon't recognize, make sure\pto register it.\nUnderstanding your POKéMON\pis an important part of\nbecoming a good trainer.\pYour observations also help\nour wildlife staff monitor\plocal populations and keep\nthe routes healthy and safe.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Contributing::
	.string "ASTRID: So we'll already be\ncontributing.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_FourTrainers::
	.string "YEW: Exactly. Four trainers\ncan observe far more than\pone researcher.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Reports::
	.string "NEVILLE: Do we have to write\nreports?$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Automatic::
	.string "YEW: No. It sends the\ninformation automatically.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Invention::
	.string "NEVILLE: Excellent\ninvention.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Appreciate::
	.string "YEW: I thought you might\nappreciate that.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Goodbyes::
	.string "YEW: Your families are\nexpecting you before you\pleave. Go and say your\ngoodbyes.\pCheck your supplies, look\nafter your partners, and\premember--you represent your\nhometown now.\pI look forward to hearing\nabout your progress.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Moving::
	.string "ASTRID: We should get\nmoving. We can reach the\pnext town before--$"

Leg_Text_Lab_GoodbyeHome::
	.string "EDWULF: You haven't said\ngoodbye at home.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_AfterThat::
	.string "ASTRID: I know. After that.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_MeetNeville::
	.string "NEVILLE: I've still got to\ngo home. Mum's packed\psomething, and I'm\napparently not allowed to\pleave without it.\pMeet you in the next town?\pWe can compare how many\nthings we forgot.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_YewAgain::
	.string "YEW: Check your supplies,\nlook after your partner, and\pfollow the route signs.\pI look forward to hearing\nabout your progress.$"

Leg_Text_Mom_First::
	.string "MOM: Oh, look at you two!\pLet me have a proper look.\nYou'll want to remember this\pday.\pDid everything go well at\nthe lab?$"

Leg_Text_Mom_Win::
	.string "MOM: Already? I knew you'd\nmake us proud.$"

Leg_Text_Mom_Battle::
	.string "MOM: And Professor Yew was\nthere? Then you couldn't\phave had a better start.$"

Leg_Text_Mom_Shoes::
	.string "MOM: I've got a couple of\nthings for you.\pThese should make those long\nroutes a little easier on\pyour feet.$"

Leg_Text_Mom_Map::
	.string "MOM: And a map. Before you\ntell me you know the\pway--take it anyway.$"

Leg_Text_Mom_Farewell::
	.string "MOM: Your first destination\nis the next town. Just\pfollow Route 1.\pIt's wonderful, really. When\nelse would children your age\pget an opportunity like\nthis?\pYour own POKéMON, a proper\njourney, and people looking\pout for you the whole way.\pI'll miss having you\nunderfoot.\pBut I'm not going to spoil\nyour big day by fussing.\pGo on. Neville's probably\npacked enough for both of\pyou.$"

Leg_Text_Mom_Again::
	.string "MOM: You can always come\nhome.\pJust leave those muddy shoes\nby the door.$"

Leg_Text_Neville_Home::
	.string "NEVILLE: She packed a second\npair of shoes.\pFor when the first pair gets\nwet.\pAnd a third pair of socks.\nFor when apparently\peverything goes wrong.$"

Leg_Text_Neville_Knows::
	.string "NEVILLE: That's what makes\nit so difficult to argue.$"

Leg_Text_Neville_Food::
	.string "NEVILLE: Yes. But I've been\ntold it has to last longer\pthan the walk out of town.$"

Leg_Text_Neville_Meet::
	.string "NEVILLE: I'll catch up with\nyou in the next town.\pDon't go beating everybody\nbefore I get there.$"

Leg_Text_Neville_Again::
	.string "NEVILLE: I know I've\nforgotten something.\pProbably whatever's under\nall the socks.$"

Leg_Text_NevMom::
	.string "NEVILLE'S MUM: Will you\nremind him to eat something\pbesides sweets?\pAnd if he says he knows a\nshortcut, ask whether he's\pactually been there.$"

Leg_Text_NevOnce::
	.string "NEVILLE: That happened once.$"

Leg_Text_NevTwice::
	.string "NEVILLE'S MUM: You were late\ntwice.$"

Leg_Text_NevMom_End::
	.string "NEVILLE'S MUM: He's been\nlooking forward to going\pwith you.\pI'm glad you'll have each\nother.$"

Leg_Text_AstridParent::
	.string "ASTRID'S MOM: She's finally\noff, then?\pWe've had weeks of breakfast\nspeeches about everything\pshe's going to accomplish.\pShe used to line her toys up\nand give them badges.\pStill, it's good to care\nabout something.\pIf you see her rushing\nahead, remind her the rest\pof the world needs time to\ncatch up.$"

Leg_Text_EdParents::
	.string "EDWULF'S MOM: You received\nyour POKéMON?\pA good companion, I hope.$"

Leg_Text_EdParents2::
	.string "EDWULF'S DAD: Did they tell\nyou when you'll be able to\pvisit home?$"

Leg_Text_EdParents_No::
	.string "EDWULF'S DAD: No. I suppose\nthere was a lot to explain.$"

Leg_Text_EdParents_Yes::
	.string "EDWULF'S DAD: Yes. Of\ncourse.$"

Leg_Text_EdParents_End::
	.string "EDWULF'S MOM: We asked\nwhether Edwulf could begin\pnext year.\pHe's young for his class.\pEDWULF'S DAD: But they've\narranged everything now.\pEDWULF'S MOM: Look after\nyourselves. All four of you.$"

Leg_Text_EdParents_Again::
	.string "EDWULF'S DAD: Tell him he\ncan write even if he hasn't\pearned a badge.$"

Leg_Text_OldMan::
	.string "OLD MAN: Used to be, you\ndidn't know what might come\pknocking after dark.\pYou'd turn the lock, check\nit twice, and say a little\pprayer it held till morning.\pNow look at us. Doors wide\nopen! Half the street\pwandering through your\nkitchen.\pMy daughter says I ought to\nget rid of the old lock.\pStill works, though. Shame\nto throw out a good lock.$"

Leg_Text_OldMan_Again::
	.string "OLD MAN: Come in, come in.\nEverybody else does.$"

Leg_Text_Resident::
	.string "Four new trainers from our\nlittle town!\pI remember when your lot\ncould barely be trusted to\pcross the square without\nbreaking something.\pDon't look at me like that.\nI remember the flowerpot.\pCome back with a badge or\ntwo. Give us something to\pboast about.$"

Leg_Text_Worker::
	.string "Heading down Route 1?\pThe signs are up, and the\npath's been checked. You\pshouldn't have any trouble\nfinding your way.\pKeep to the marked trail. If\nthere's a closure notice,\pit's there for a reason.\pThe POKéMON don't read the\nsigns, unfortunately. That\ppart keeps us busy.$"

Leg_Text_FastLevel::
	.string "I used to stick with the\nsame team because bringing\panyone new up to speed took\nforever.\pIf you've enabled Fast\nLeveling, ask at a POKéMON\pCenter.\pThey can bring another\nPOKéMON up to your trainer\plevel immediately. Now I can\nuse the right POKéMON for\peach task without having to\nspend time grinding levels\pon my recently caught\nPOKéMON.$"

Leg_Text_FastLevel_Off::
	.string "You can enable it in your\ntraining preferences if you\pchange your mind.$"

Leg_Text_SetMoves::
	.string "A POKéMON can know more than\nfour moves. Four is just how\pmany you take into a battle.\pIf you've enabled Set Moves,\nyou can change that\pselection from its menu\nwhenever you want.\pI like being able to prepare\na custom moveset for\pimportant battles.$"

Leg_Text_Child::
	.string "You got yours today?\pI'm choosing that one when\nit's my turn.\pUnless they have something\nbetter.\pDon't tell it I said that.$"

Leg_Text_Boundary::
	.string "ROUTE 1\nNEXT TOWN AHEAD\pRegistered trainers: carry\nyour POKéDEX and follow\pposted route guidance.$"

Leg_Text_NeedMom::
	.string "You should say goodbye at\nhome before leaving town.$"

Leg_Text_Complete::
	.string "LEG ONE COMPLETE\pYour journey begins here.\pThis build ends at the Route\n1 boundary. You can return\pto town, speak to everyone,\nand save your progress.$"

Leg_Text_Heal::
	.string "Your POKéMON are fully\nrested.$"

Leg_Text_Prefs::
	.string "Please review your training\npreferences.\pBattle style and text speed\nare also available from\pOPTIONS in the START menu.$"

Leg_Text_Prefs_Nick::
	.string "Automatically open the\nnickname screen for received\pPOKéMON?$"

Leg_Text_Prefs_Fast::
	.string "Enable Fast Leveling?$"

Leg_Text_Prefs_Moves::
	.string "Enable Set Moves?$"

Leg_Text_Prefs_Done::
	.string "Everything in order?\pThen we can begin.$"

Leg_Text_Guide::
	.string "Training preferences can be\nreviewed at the terminal in\pProfessor Yew's lab.\pPress START to save. Hold B\nto run once you've collected\pyour shoes.$"

Leg_Text_TownMap::
	.string "Your map shows your hometown\nand the Route 1 exit. The\prest of your journey lies\nahead.$"

Leg_Text_Sign_Mom::
	.string "{PLAYER}'s home$"

Leg_Text_Sign_Neville::
	.string "Neville's home$"

Leg_Text_Sign_Astrid::
	.string "Astrid's home$"

Leg_Text_Sign_Edwulf::
	.string "Edwulf's home$"

Leg_Text_Sign_OldMan::
	.string "A well-kept home. The door\nis wide open.$"

Leg_Text_Sign_Lab::
	.string "Regional POKéMON Training\nProgram\pProfessor Yew's Laboratory$"

Leg_Text_ShoesReceived::
	.string "{PLAYER} received the\nRunning Shoes!\pHold B while walking to run.$"

Leg_Text_MapReceived::
	.string "{PLAYER} received the Town\nMap!\pUse it from the KEY ITEMS\npocket.$"

Leg_Text_DexReceived::
	.string "{PLAYER} received a POKéDEX!$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Chosen::
	.string "YEW: {STR_VAR_1}. A fine\nchoice.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_Table::
	.string "Examine a Poké Ball on the\ntable to meet the POKéMON\pinside.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_FinishChoosing::
	.string "Choose your partner before\nleaving the lab.$"

Leg_Text_Lab_NevilleThinking::
	.string "NEVILLE: Right. Yes. I've\nthought about this.$"

Leg_Text_Home_Bed::
	.string "Your own bed. A little rest\nbefore the journey?$"

Leg_Text_Home_PC::
	.string "A half-finished game is\nstill on the screen. It'll\phave to wait.$"

Leg_Text_Ball_0::
	.string "VULPIX\pFIRE type. A clever little\nfox with six warm tails.\pChoose this POKéMON?$"

Leg_Text_Ball_1::
	.string "PSYDUCK\pWATER type. A curious duck\nwhose headaches hide\psurprising power.\pChoose this POKéMON?$"

Leg_Text_Ball_2::
	.string "PHANPY\pGROUND type. A sturdy little\nelephant with a playful\ptrunk.\pChoose this POKéMON?$"

Leg_Text_Ball_3::
	.string "CRABRAWLER\pFIGHTING type. A determined\ncrab, always ready to raise\pits claws.\pChoose this POKéMON?$"

Leg_Text_Ball_4::
	.string "DEERLING\pNORMAL / GRASS type. A\nnimble woodland POKéMON that\pchanges with the seasons.\pChoose this POKéMON?$"

